{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"trinket_charm","model_identifier":"trinket_charm","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"## trinket_charm\n\nTrinket, charm.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x16, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -8.5..0.0, z -0.3..0.3 (size 4.0 x 8.5 x 0.7 u = 11 x 24 x 2 cm).\nCharm: a small stepped pendant (4 u wide, diamond-ish in three steps and a tip) with notched edges, on a short chain of three alternating links. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: bronze. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_charm_copper.png`, `trinket_charm_tin.png`, `trinket_charm_bronze.png`, `trinket_charm_iron.png`, `trinket_charm_steel.png`, `trinket_charm_silver.png`, `trinket_charm_gold.png`\n"},"description":"## trinket_charm\n\nTrinket, charm.\n\n- Cubes: 7 (0 rotated). Texture 32x32 (padded from 32x16; UVs unchanged), 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Bounds at rest: x -2.0..2.0, y -8.5..0.0, z -0.3..0.3 (size 4.0 x 8.5 x 0.7 u = 11 x 24 x 2 cm).\nCharm: a small stepped pendant (4 u wide, diamond-ish in three steps and a tip) with notched edges, on a short chain of three alternating links. Origin = the hanging point (top of the cord/chain); the trinket hangs below it facing -Z. Shown upright in trade screens; laid flat by the game as a world prop. Embedded texture: bronze. Metal textures: copper, tin, bronze, iron, steel, silver, gold.\n\n- Variant textures (same UV layout): `trinket_charm_copper.png`, `trinket_charm_tin.png`, `trinket_charm_bronze.png`, `trinket_charm_iron.png`, `trinket_charm_steel.png`, `trinket_charm_silver.png`, `trinket_charm_gold.png`\n","resolution":{"w